OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister receives police
OL,4,Aletter over Garvaghy Road protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Fsaid she has received a letter from
OL,8,Fpolice investigating protests over the
OL,9,FDrumcree parading dispute.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, the police said they had
OL,12,Fbegun issuing letters inviting people
OL,13,F"reasonably suspected" of committing
OL,14,Foffences linked to the protests to
OL,15,Finterview.
OL,17,FUnionist politicians have called for
OL,18,Faction to be taken against O'Neill and
OL,19,Fother senior Sinn Fein politicians who
OL,20,Ftook part in the protests against the
OL,21,FOrange Order march down the Garvaghy
OL,22,FRoad at the end of last month.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
