OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister receives police
OL,4,Aletter over Garvaghy Road protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Neill has previously defended her
OL,7,Fattendance, saying she was "proud to
OL,8,Fstand with the residents" and that
OL,9,F"when the law is wrong, I will stand
OL,10,Ffirmly against it".
